==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|symbolique}} or directly from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|symbolicus}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|συμβολικός||of or belonging to a [[symbol]]}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɒlɪk|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Pertaining to a [[symbol]].
